{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","翱翔天际的白银之翼"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","玛露西尔的所有技能均需要吟唱施法。主动使用时持续施法召唤天空鱼攻击敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身的各项技能均需要消耗时间吟唱施法，但玛露西尔会不间断地尝试释放各项技能，且其吟唱速度会受到急速和攻击速度的共同影响。每当玛露西尔成功地完成一次吟唱，便会永久提高自身10点急速与5%能量恢复速度，最多叠加10次。\n主动使用时，立即扣除200点魔法值，并且每秒持续消耗80法力值吟唱施法，召唤天空鱼在场上冲刺，每次攻击会对一条路径上的所有敌人造成500% + 50% ATK伤害。天空鱼冲刺的基础吟唱频率为每2秒一次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":181,"end":187,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":177,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至530% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至540% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至550% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","爆炸魔法"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，释放爆炸魔法对一片范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱3秒后，在敌方最密集区域施放爆炸魔法，对半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 40% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至330% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至370% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","闪光魔法"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，释放闪光魔法，对一名友军产生治疗，伤害并致盲其附近的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱2秒后，在一名身边有敌人的友军身边产生耀眼的光芒，为其恢复300% + 30% ATK生命值，并对周围所有敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害并使其致盲，持续4 + 0.4秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":63,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升急速。终极技能吟唱期间额外提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升10点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升14点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升7点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升18点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升8点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","禁忌的古代魔法"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，施法古代魔法，复活一名友方英雄。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在脚下生成古代魔法阵。吟唱3秒后，复活一名友方英雄，并使其恢复400% ATK生命值，每场战斗最多只能成功释放1次。布阵时，若自己身前1格处有友军，则本技能只会选择该友军为目标。若己方上阵了莱欧斯，则本技能可以额外复活一次莱欧斯（无需满足站位条件、且不消耗本技能的使用次数），但每场战斗最多只能触发1次。若本技能在吟唱过程中被打断，则后续5秒内无法再次释放。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","被复活的友方英雄生命值恢复提高至450% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能吟唱期间，古代魔法阵每秒会对场上所有敌人造成250% ATK伤害，并吸收伤害量的100%，将这部分数值增加至复活目标的生命恢复量当中。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","被复活的友方英雄生命值恢复提高至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","玛露西尔拥有来自其他友军的属性提升效果时，每秒可额外恢复能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔当前每拥有一个来自不同友军的属性提升效果，每秒便会额外恢复10点能量，该效果最多同时叠加3层。当拥有3层该效果时，玛露西尔获得霸体。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","安布罗希亚"]]}